  // Pilot rest/duty and minimum turnaround for the weekly schedule builder.
  // Shared across playstyles: a duty day and a legal rest period are
  // working-time facts, not something that should differ by how realistically the player wants to
  // be billed. 10h rest / 13h max duty are ordinary short-haul crewing figures. minTurnaroundMinutes
  // corrected 2026-08-12 from 45 to 30: 45 is a full-service average, not the fastest a turnaround
  // can plausibly go - a low-cost narrowbody figure (which is what this floor represents) turns in
  // 25-30 minutes. The floor is the fastest legally allowed, not the realistic default; the player
  // still chooses their own turnaround time per leg, this only bounds how tight they may cut it.
